WEBVTT

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.040
I'm off the clock!

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.880
See you, Sonozaki-<i>san</i>! And thanks
for coming in on such short notice.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.090
No prob.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:12.980
Higurashi: When They Cry SOTSU

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:15.700
Listen up, class!

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:19.450
If you don't take cooking seriously,
somebody's going to get hurt!

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:23.960
This is a part of your class today,
so don't fool around! Take this seriously!

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.960
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:31.800
Boy, she sure is fired up
about curry, huh?

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:35.010
Chie-<i>sensei </i>puts her whole life
and soul into curry.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:37.510
She's gonna be harsh
when grading us on this.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.850
It's just cooking.
We can half-ass it and get full points.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.100
You shouldn't say that out loud!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:46.020
If she hears you...

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.440
Don't be dramatic.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:50.770
Besides, curry is basically junk food.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.320
It always tastes the same.
Anyone would get sick of--

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.120
Okay, let's get serious!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.670
I know I don't have
to say this, Kei-<i>chan</i>...

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.460
You guys get it, too, yeah?

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.880
Our club activity today
is a curry showdown!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.130
A wonderful idea!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:21.050
My year is making curry in a group,
so your participant will be...

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:25.810
Me! My curry's gonna be so yummy,
you'll go crazy for it!

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:29.150
Rika's a pretty good cook, too!

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.270
Dammit. No fair, Satoko!

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:35.690
I'm good at making curry, so you'd better
get ready to lose, Keiichi-<i>kun</i>!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.240
So many fierce opponents... save for one!

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.950
Wait... no, you can't be!

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:47.710
"I bet Mion's a horrible cook!"

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.130
You totally thought
you could beat me, didn't you?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.380
Wha--?!

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.760
I'm not gonna let you guys win!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:06.520
I'll show you what my Dad taught me
about cooking when we went camping!

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:13.900
Shouldn't you take off
the lid on that already?

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.740
If you're trying to trick me, Satoko,
that's not going to work.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:21.240
I know how to cook rice:
you let it bubble and steam,

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.410
and <i>never </i>take off
the lid until it's done!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.490
Wow, you actually know stuff,
Kei-<i>chan</i>.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.330
So you'd better turn tail and run off!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.290
You leave me no choice, then.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.880
Oh, my, I must have tripped!

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:46.010
My hand slipped!

